    name="{=MVOldVaegirGuards}The Old Vaegir Guards"
    short_name="{=MVOldVaegirGuardsShort}Vaegir Guards"
    tier="1"
    text="{=MVOldVaegirGuardsText}The Old Vaegir Guards were once an elite household force directly commanded by Emperor Arenicos. When the emperor died unexpectedly, the guard was blamed for failing to protect him and dismissed from Imperial service. Stripped of their old banners and without a place in the reorganized armies, they now wander between Sturgia and the northern Empire in search of new employers and worthy wars. They retain the discipline of a palace guard, the pride of veterans, and a bitter memory of the court that cast them aside.">
